# 🚀 Equifax QA – Test Scenario Generator

This repository is designed to automate the generation of structured **Equifax test scenarios** and export them into a **well-formatted Excel report** using an AI-powered agent.

---

## 📌 Overview

This project uses an **AAVA Agent (CrewAI-based)** to:

- ✅ Read user stories / requirements
- ✅ Automatically generate test scenarios
- ✅ Structure them into standardized test cases
- ✅ Convert them into a formatted Excel file
- ✅ Upload the generated Excel file directly to GitHub

